        "steam_appid": 4089530,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089530/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1762518032\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>OPEN YOUR EYES is a grid-based puzzle game about perception, logic, and discovery. Each level challenges you to open every eye on the board, but the rules change as new eyes are introduced. Some eyes open with a simple click, while others react to lasers, electricity, or the passage of time. To succeed, you must think ahead, manipulate interactions, and plan your moves with precision.<br><br>Across 19 handcrafted levels, new mechanics are layered in to create increasingly complex puzzles. Clear each stage in the fewest possible moves to earn top ranks, and test how clearly you can see the solution. With its neon glow and surreal eye motifs, OPEN YOUR EYES offers a puzzle experience that is both logical and dreamlike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089530/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1762518032\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>19 handcrafted levels</strong> with escalating complexity<br></li><li><strong>7 unique eye types</strong>, each with distinct rules and interactions<br></li><li><strong>Additional objects like redirectors</strong> to manipulate puzzle flow<br></li><li><strong>Ranking system</strong> (C to S) rewarding efficiency and intentional play<br></li><li><strong>A surreal neon aesthetic</strong> blending mysticism and minimalism</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089530/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1762518032\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Techno